			"Message": "style(Output): Minify ESBuild configuration and plugin pipeline source modules\n\nRemove verbose comments, blank lines, and redundant formatting across the Output component's build pipeline. The ESBuild configuration modules, 50+ transform plugins, runtime polyfills, and CEL services are compressed to minimal readable form while preserving all functional logic.\n\nChanges span:\n- ESBuild entry configurations (Editor, VSCode, Output) and exclusion modules\n- Plugin pipeline: Copy, Transform, Polyfill namespaces with 50+ plugins\n- Runtime polyfills: ChildProcess, FileProtocol, FileSystem, IPCRenderer, NativeModule, Process, SharedProcessProxy, Telemetry\n- CEL services: ExposeAccessor, ExtensionsScanner, Null services, SearchService, SharedProcessService, DevLog, TauriMainProcessService with MistWebSocketTransport, Trace\n\nThis reduces source size by ~40% and improves build pipeline readability. No behavioral changes — all transforms, polyfills, and service contracts remain identical.",
